# Wee Weekly Brackets and Points

For every prompt or update, determine whether it affects draws, seeding, byes, doubles teams, matches, rounds, consolation, scores, results, points, rankings, leaderboards, or bracket presentation.

If it does:

1. Read and apply `.cursor/skills/wee-weekly-brackets-points/SKILL.md` before acting.
2. Preserve the ATP/ITF-style draw invariants and custom Wee Weekly points table.
3. Keep canonical calculations in `src/lib/tournamentUtils.js` and align server-side leaderboard calculations.
4. Do not change bracket or points rules without identifying the impact and obtaining explicit user approval.
5. Apply `.cursor/skills/material-design-3-frontend/SKILL.md` to bracket UI work.
6. Test the affected draw, progression, scoring, and ranking invariants.
